{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e2e7fb54f3d417423e24a1a60ecef43f932be4002d90d8784d3840daf65fb923","ja":"やっぱり遅いね。\n律子さん、まだ来ないのかな……？","zh":"果然很慢呢。\n律子小姐还没来吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9658c823b5cfae1f4a248703d6352cf712f6556ecf580cf9769f22a4250a89a8","ja":"ちゃんとメモを置いてきてるし、\nここでのんびり待ってればいいって♪","zh":"已经好好留了便条，\n只要在这里悠闲地等着就好啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3a491417882648741b6f181b5d0128971ea3eb22b35c4e59ae299f35a8bc86bf","ja":"でもやっぱり気になるなーって……。\n私、ちょっと見てくるね。みんなはここで待ってて！","zh":"不过果然还是有点在意啊……\n我去稍微看一下哦。大家在这里等我！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e898518b3a78d18f2a8d3257517d48bdf103de359c092dde61362b36e098e32a","ja":"あっ……！","zh":"啊……！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e363d25f4ce9c708f4a7f5d99235666b5dda7531539c493ce521c6d6964fbf35","ja":"あっ、律子さん！\n来てたんですね！","zh":"啊，律子小姐！\n你来了呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3c21bf29a30a94b71cbbd590a850caab9c933bbbdb2a10f1b1b9c34bbfe6e566","ja":"やっぱりこっちで合ってたのね。\n他のみんなは屋上？","zh":"果然没走错呢。\n其他人都在屋顶吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"385e91e8612c997dbc9be27a3e958d8572aedbec50e4599794d578193fac94b3","ja":"はい。……って、あれ？\n控え室にメモがありませんでしたか？","zh":"是的。……咦，等等？\n休息室里没有留字条吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e1b0c0981146839363964e98c4b89b9f4f0df4cdbe7de991def369961a75d140","ja":"ええ、あったわよ。これのことでしょ？","zh":"嗯，有的哦。你说的是这个吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"90bb6cae3f04e15ac64df70edfde14ce60ce1a6a8566407b3f7b72dd1bda18fe","ja":"えっと……「日の光を手に収めれば、\n探しものが見つかるであろう～」……！？","zh":"那个……“若将日光收于掌中，\n便能寻得所求之物吧～”……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"325bb736336f034a3d55ac2672e3e059b935ec0f473ac7fd7fbb029402734d82","ja":"「あと、やよいっちはお仕事中だから\n連絡しちゃダメだよ～」？","zh":"“还有，弥生现在在工作，\n不可以联络她哦～”？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"706721812f167a5a1e2e4add123c11f0bfaa43a4372adb689b3dffee8300a4f7","ja":"はぁ～……亜美たちに連絡しても出ないし……。","zh":"唉～……联系亚美她们也没接……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"020e1d3729ee19313990d0f94c1d2c6f7bb6ced1057880272e186fd01bf3511a","ja":"仕方ないから外に出てみたり、\n照明が強いステージに行ってみたり、大変だったわ。","zh":"没办法，只能试着去室外，\n又试着去灯光很强的舞台，真是折腾死我了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"72fc677172f65e9ca7399cdac0642724d20a880f2c8aa72b91a8239251309859","ja":"はわわっ、そんなことになってたんですね……！\nごめんなさい！","zh":"哇哇，居然变成那样了啊……！\n对不起！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"b497bd3d4d91de3f5b9ef1af17aa9a6adb9dea7ee21636b456edf6c57d6571a9","ja":"やよいが謝らなくてもいいのよ。","zh":"弥生用不着道歉哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"056441f40808a77475efa05f11f8787f7691936aeee64941b15bd7c0344d69ac","ja":"どうせ亜美と真美に、私が来るまで\nもっと休憩してよう、とか言われたんでしょ？","zh":"反正是被亚美和真美说了“在我来之前\n再多休息一会儿吧”之类的话吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"d695ae7cb2f69ac5bc5c7a9a8a05c0f9ffaf71813041b9160f902465c7eb3623","ja":"ええっ！　律子さん、どうしてわかるんですか！？","zh":"咦！律子，你怎么会知道的！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"e241077002b99e396e7d59f1ad4dc7f72f45bf55bae5d07bf5bfd18d9f0aee2d","ja":"今日の陽気で屋上にいて、分かりにくいメモで\n私を足止めしたってなったら想像もつくわよ。","zh":"今天天气这么好，又待在楼顶，还留了张\n莫名其妙的便签把我叫住，我怎么可能想不到呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1385.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"4364e5148ccc75d10468c22b95e3fcb0491e607e19e5600e2c8273982c496a9a","ja":"さ、他の3人も呼びに行きましょう。\n遅れた分も、た～っぷりミーティングしないとね♪","zh":"好了，去叫另外3个人吧。\n迟到的那份时间，也得好～好开会补回来呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
